  "faq1Respuesta": "Access the \"My donations\" section from your profile or tap the \"Give / Donate\" button on your church's screen. You will be able to select the mission project, enter the amount, and proceed securely.",
  "faq2Pregunta": "How do I send and check the status of my pastoral requests?",
  "faq2Respuesta": "Go to the \"My requests\" section in your profile or from your church menu. There you can submit prayer, counseling, or community support requests and check your community's response.",
  "faq3Pregunta": "Where can I explore nearby churches and view them on the map?",
  "faq3Respuesta": "From the home screen, tap \"Explore Churches\" or the interactive map. You can filter by Christian tradition, check service times, lead pastors, and get directions on the map.",
  "faq4Pregunta": "Can I read the Bible and save notes or favorites offline?",
  "faq4Respuesta": "Yes! The Bible text, your study notes, and highlighted verses are safely stored locally on your device via SQLite so you can enjoy them anytime.",
  "faq5Pregunta": "How do I update my profile details or switch churches?",
  "faq5Respuesta": "In the Profile tab, tap \"My details\" or the edit button to update your name, email, or mobile phone. If you want to affiliate with another community, tap \"Switch church\".",
